meta {
  name: Send Message
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "message": "Halo, apa kabar hari ini?",
    "context": "greeting"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Send Message
  
  Mengirim pesan ke AI assistant untuk konsultasi.
  
  ### Body Parameters:
  - `message` (string, required): Pesan yang dikirim
  - `context` (string, optional): Konteks percakapan
  
  ### Response:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "messageId": "msg_id",
      "response": "Halo! Saya baik...",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-27T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  **Note:** Memerlukan permission `canAIChat` dan subject to daily limit
}
